{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-cdn-scheduling","title":"多 CDN 智能调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-live-commerce/interaction/multi-cdn-scheduling","wordCount":1446,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"多-cdn-智能调度\">多 CDN 智能调度</h1><p>直播电商对 CDN 的依赖程度远超普通网站——视频流的持续高带宽、实时延迟敏感性、以及用户地理分布的不均匀性，使得单一 CDN 的稳定性难以满足生产要求。头部平台通常同时签约 3-5 家 CDN 供应商（阿里云、腾讯云、网宿、白山、华为云），并构建一套「多 CDN 调度系统」，实现质量探测、故障切换、成本优化的自动化编排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>CDN PoP（Point of Presence）</strong>：CDN 的边缘节点，分布在各城市的机房。用户就近连接最近的 PoP，视频缓存在该节点上，减少回源到源站的次数。</p>\n<p><strong>回源率（Cache Miss Rate）</strong>：CDN 没有命中缓存，需要回到源站拉取的比例。直播流的回源率理论上是 100%（每个新分片都需要一次回源），因此直播 CDN 的核心指标是「分发带宽」而非「缓存命中率」。</p>\n<p><strong>首屏时间（TTFF，Time to First Frame）</strong>：从请求播放到看到第一帧，包含 DNS 解析、TCP 握手、HTTP 请求、服务端响应等环节。TTFF 目标 &lt; 1s。</p>\n<p><strong>视频卡顿率（Stall Rate）</strong>：播放过程中因缓冲不足而暂停的比例和时长。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质量指标</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n<th>影响因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首屏时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s</td>\n<td>CDN 节点距离、DNS 解析速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡顿率</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5%</td>\n<td>带宽、节点负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1%</td>\n<td>节点稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均码率</td>\n<td>达到期望码率的 90%</td>\n<td>节点带宽充足度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cdn-调度架构\">CDN 调度架构</h2><p>多 CDN 调度系统由三个核心模块组成：质量探测、调度决策、客户端执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|拉流请求| B[调度服务]&#10;    B --&gt;|查询| C[质量数据库]&#10;    C --&gt;|历史质量指标| B&#10;    B --&gt;|选择最优 CDN| D[返回 CDN URL]&#10;    A --&gt;|播放| E[CDN 节点]&#10;    E --&gt;|质量指标上报| F[质量采集]&#10;    F --&gt;|写入| C&#10;&#10;    G[探测 Agent] --&gt;|主动拨测| E&#10;    G --&gt;|更新质量| C\">graph TD\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|拉流请求| B[调度服务]\n    B --&gt;|查询| C[质量数据库]\n    C --&gt;|历史质量指标| B\n    B --&gt;|选择最优 CDN| D[返回 CDN URL]\n    A --&gt;|播放| E[CDN 节点]\n    E --&gt;|质量指标上报| F[质量采集]\n    F --&gt;|写入| C\n\n    G[探测 Agent] --&gt;|主动拨测| E\n    G --&gt;|更新质量| C</pre><p><strong>调度层位置</strong>：调度服务通常以两种形式存在：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>服务端调度</strong>：客户端请求调度服务获取播流地址，调度服务根据客户端 IP 和实时质量数据返回最优 URL。延迟约 50ms 但精准度高</li>\n<li><strong>DNS 调度（GSLB）</strong>：通过智能 DNS 将不同地区的域名解析到不同 CDN 节点。零延迟但更新慢（TTL 限制）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>两种方案通常组合使用：DNS 做粗粒度地区分流，服务端调度做精细选节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量探测系统\">质量探测系统</h2><p>探测系统负责实时掌握各 CDN 节点的质量状况，是智能调度的数据基础。</p>\n<p><strong>主动拨测（Synthetic Monitoring）</strong>：在不同城市部署探测 Agent，定期向各 CDN 节点发起视频拉流，测量以下指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首包时延（Time to First Byte）</li>\n<li>下载速率（吞吐量）</li>\n<li>错误率（HTTP 4xx/5xx 比例）</li>\n<li>视频卡顿模拟</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>被动质量上报（Passive Monitoring）</strong>：客户端播放器实时上报质量数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"message StreamQualityReport {&#10;  string cdn_id = 1;        // 使用的 CDN 节点 ID&#10;  string user_ip = 2;       // 用户 IP（用于地域分析）&#10;  int32 ttff_ms = 3;        // 首屏时间&#10;  int32 stall_count = 4;    // 卡顿次数&#10;  int32 stall_duration_ms = 5; // 卡顿总时长&#10;  int32 current_bitrate = 6;   // 当前码率（kbps）&#10;  int32 expected_bitrate = 7;  // 目标码率（kbps）&#10;  int32 error_code = 8;        // 错误码（0=正常）&#10;  int64 timestamp = 9;         // 上报时间戳&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>message StreamQualityReport {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string cdn_id = 1;        // 使用的 CDN 节点 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string user_ip = 2;       // 用户 IP（用于地域分析）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 ttff_ms = 3;        // 首屏时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 stall_count = 4;    // 卡顿次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 stall_duration_ms = 5; // 卡顿总时长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 current_bitrate = 6;   // 当前码率（kbps）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 expected_bitrate = 7;  // 目标码率（kbps）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int32 error_code = 8;        // 错误码（0=正常）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 timestamp = 9;         // 上报时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>质量得分模型</strong>：将多维指标归一化为单一质量分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Quality = w_1 \\times \\frac{1}{TTFF} + w_2 \\times \\frac{bitrate_{actual}}{bitrate_{expected}} + w_3 \\times (1 - stall\\_rate) + w_4 \\times (1 - error\\_rate)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">bi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型权重：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1 = 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span>（首屏），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2 = 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>（码率达成），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3 = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>（流畅度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_4 = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>（稳定性）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障切换机制\">故障切换机制</h2><p>CDN 故障通常表现为：HTTP 503 错误率突升、视频首帧超时、大量用户卡顿投诉。故障切换需要在 30s 内完成，否则大量观众已经离开直播间。</p>\n<p><strong>故障检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>阈值告警：任意 CDN 的 5 分钟错误率 &gt; 2% 触发告警</li>\n<li>异常检测：基于历史均值 + 3σ 标准差的动态阈值</li>\n<li>用户投诉突增：投诉量 5 分钟环比 &gt; 3 倍触发紧急切换</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>切换策略</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{CDN 故障类型} --&gt; B[部分节点故障]&#10;    A --&gt; C[整体服务降级]&#10;    A --&gt; D[某地区故障]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt;|排除故障节点| E[重新分配流量到其他节点]&#10;    C --&gt;|完全切换| F[切换到备用 CDN]&#10;    D --&gt;|地区级切换| G[该地区用户切换到次优 CDN]\">graph TD\n    A{CDN 故障类型} --&gt; B[部分节点故障]\n    A --&gt; C[整体服务降级]\n    A --&gt; D[某地区故障]\n\n    B --&gt;|排除故障节点| E[重新分配流量到其他节点]\n    C --&gt;|完全切换| F[切换到备用 CDN]\n    D --&gt;|地区级切换| G[该地区用户切换到次优 CDN]</pre><p><strong>切换速度优化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预热（Warm-up）</strong>：备用 CDN 始终保持 10-20% 的流量，避免在紧急切换时面对「冷启动」问题（首次访问需要回源，延迟高）</li>\n<li><strong>客户端兜底</strong>：播放器内置多 URL 列表（主 URL + 备用 URL），主 URL 连续失败 3 次自动切换备用 URL，无需等待服务端调度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化策略\">成本优化策略</h2><p>CDN 带宽费用通常按 <strong>95 分位峰值带宽</strong> 计费（一个月的带宽采样点去掉最高的 5%，剩余最大值作为计费带宽）。直播的带宽波动特性（秒杀时峰值是平均值的 3-5 倍）使得纯按峰值计费成本极高。</p>\n<p><strong>多 CDN 峰谷互补</strong>：不同 CDN 的计费周期和计费逻辑有差异，通过在多家之间分配流量，分散峰值。</p>\n<p><strong>时间段定向调度</strong>：不同时段的 CDN 价格不同（夜间 00:00-08:00 通常有低价套餐），调度系统可将 VOD 回放流量定向到低价时段/低价 CDN，直播流量保持高质量优先。</p>\n<p><strong>流量分配优化模型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CDN</th>\n<th>单价（元/Gbps）</th>\n<th>质量评分</th>\n<th>当前分配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A 厂</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>92分</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 厂</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>88分</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 厂</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>82分</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D 厂（应急）</td>\n<td>150</td>\n<td>95分</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在质量评分满足基准线（&gt;80分）的前提下，优化目标是最小化总成本。这是一个带约束的线性规划问题，调度系统每小时重新计算最优分配比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多 CDN 调度系统三层：质量探测（主动拨测 + 被动上报）→ 调度决策（质量评分模型）→ 客户端执行（服务端返回 URL + 客户端多 URL 兜底）</li>\n<li>质量探测核心指标：首屏时间、卡顿率、错误率、码率达成率，归一化为质量分</li>\n<li>故障切换目标：30s 内完成，依赖预热（常态保持 10-20% 备用流量）</li>\n<li>客户端兜底：播放器内置多 URL 列表，连续 3 次失败自动切换，无需服务端介入</li>\n<li>成本优化：按 95 分位峰值计费机制下，多 CDN 分流分散峰值，时段调度利用低价窗口</li>\n<li>调度决策每小时重算一次（质量 + 成本联合最优），故障时实时触发强制切换</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多 CDN 智能调度","id":"多-cdn-智能调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CDN 调度架构","id":"cdn-调度架构"},{"level":2,"text":"质量探测系统","id":"质量探测系统"},{"level":2,"text":"故障切换机制","id":"故障切换机制"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化策略","id":"成本优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"弹幕实时分发系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-live-commerce/interaction/danmu-comment-system"},"next":{"title":"商品卡片浮层与展示引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-live-commerce/commerce/product-card-overlay"}}